00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:05.730
<i>Central Flonyard is well into autumn.</i>

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:10.900
<i>We encountered a bit of trouble
following the return of our heroes,</i>

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:17.160
<i>but since that was taken care of, they've
settled down in their respective countries.</i>

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:20.160
And now...

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:23.620
I'm ready to play with everybody today,

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:27.630
<i>and</i> do some field work for the academy!

