00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:04.810
I haven't traveled with you in quite some time!

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:06.770
Who's a good boy?

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:06.100
Seriously!

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:13.360
The road we're taking is beautiful this time of year!

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:14.730
Great!

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:14.730
Nice!

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:15.860
Hey!

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:19.360
Princess!

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:21.240
Rebecca-sama!

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.620
We're here!

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:25.370
Morning!

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:27.540
Morning, Shinku and Rico-chan!

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:29.250
Good morning!

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:30.870
Good morning!

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.880
Is this how we're traveling, Rico-chan?

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:35.380
Yes!

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.630
That's a lot of stuff...

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:40.130
You think so?

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:43.470
I packed researching gear, lunch, extra clothes...

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:46.390
All completely necessary for our trip!

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.680
And the rest of the bags are filled with toys, right?

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:50.890
Shh, Yukkii!

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:54.690
This trip is for <i>academic</i> purposes!

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:55.900
Oh, right!

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:59.690
Biscotti and Pastillage are conducting this research together, right?

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:00.900
Yes!

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:06.660
Once we're done, we'll take a dip in the hot springs!

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:14.210
I found an excellent location last time I visited the area!

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:16.670
I'm so excited!

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:20.880
I wish Eclair was traveling with us too.

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:25.050
She said she'd catch up by sunset!

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:27.430
She's with Cou-sama now, right?

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:28.180
Yes.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:34.020
I believe she's going to escort Cou-sama to us.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.440
Right.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:39.190
All right, let's get going!

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:40.940
Yeah!

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:47.410
The wind feels great!

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:48.410
Yeah.

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:52.410
Thanks for coming all the way out here.

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:57.380
I already had other obligations in Pastillage,
 so it's quite all right.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:59.210
As a token of my gratitude...

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:00.920
You can't tell anyone!

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:03.470
I'll let you touch my tail!

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:07.180
Come, now!

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.680
Don't be shy!

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.520
It's all right, your highness.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.430
I really shouldn't.

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:17.480
Well, we'd better do what we have to...

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:21.110
and go to the hot spring with Millhi-nee!

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:22.610
Yes!

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:24.650
I'll do my best!

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:27.620
Whoa!

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:29.660
It's all red!

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.870
It's unreal!

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.830
Isn't it amazing?

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:37.380
This is Biscotti's famous "Vermilion Parkway!"

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:41.750
The spirits of the tree are singing the song of autumn!

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:47.430
It's a great location for a stroll this time of year!

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:49.260
Wow!

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:03.860
The trees give us their fruit as they prepare for the winter!

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:08.950
You'll find lots of fruits and nuts around here!

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:10.280
I see.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:16.250
That helps bears and other larger animals prepare for hibernation.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:19.290
Of course, we can have some too!

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:22.040
That's just like Earth.

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:29.930
The spirits of fall and winter are especially active between Biscotti and Pastillage.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:32.560
The area will be covered in snow in a few months!

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:38.730
Meanwhile in Galette, the winter spirits don't do much, so...

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:41.860
It's not terribly cold there,

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:45.990
but it looks like it's more than cold enough for them.

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:53.280
It's Galettian tradition to stay warm 
and cozy at home during the winter.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.830
That makes so much sense!

00:05:55.830 --> 00:06:02.880
Once we hit the fork in this road, we're almost there.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:05.460
Let's pick up the pace a bit.

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:06.920
Okay!

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:13.180
So, Rico, we're headed to a mine, right?

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:14.350
That's right!

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:20.440
Magic crystals pop out left and right here,

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:24.110
between trees, rivers, and waterfalls.

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:28.740
The feeling is quite mysterious and surreal!

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:34.700
We've only visited once, but it was certainly a sight to behold.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:36.040
Definitely!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:41.330
I'm sure the both of you will absolutely love it!

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.500
Oh, man!

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:46.880
Wow!

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:53.430
The terrain is a little rough because nobody ever really comes here,

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:55.760
but I'm sure <i>you'll</i> be all right, Shinku.

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:56.260
Yeah.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:07:01.390
Rebecca-sama, you're fine because you'll be flying, right?

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:02.850
Bingo!

00:07:02.850 --> 00:07:05.270
Okay, work comes first!

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:07.360
Let's get ready!

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:13.110
...And that's how we will conduct this investigation!

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:18.490
All right! Let's investigate the abundance and purity of the ore!

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:20.250
Yeah!

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.830
Okay, I'll go check from the skies.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.130
Mercurius,

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.840
broom mode!

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.260
Care for a ride, Princess?

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:33.010
I'd love to!

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:34.180
See you!

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:36.260
Good luck!

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:38.180
Thanks!

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:45.690
This is quite a bit purer than I had expected!

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.570
Oh, lookie here!

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:51.860
What's this ore...

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:53.280
used for?

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:59.910
Mostly to perform crystal spells.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:03.410
Oh yeah?

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:04.710
For example,

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:10.420
these white crystals are used to make crystal circuits.

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:13.090
And, uh...

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:20.010
we use those red ones to amplify magic power.

00:08:20.010 --> 00:08:20.930
Cool...

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:24.440
The growth rate is quite impressive as well!

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:30.690
We should be able to collect more than enough sustainable samples with this!

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:32.280
That's good to hear!

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:34.240
Shinku,

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:39.660
this ore is generated by the power of the land.

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:40.450
Right.

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:44.250
That's why we can only collect however much grew out since our last visit

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:45.960
instead of taking all of it at once.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.380
That's what sustainable collection is about.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:55.380
We borrow just a bit from the land so that we don't disturb nature.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.550
I see.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:09:02.600
The ores and crystals here are 
necessary components of our technology,

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:06.440
but they're no more important than the land itself.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.400
I see.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:11.980
Hey, Princess...

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.820
What is that?

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:22.870
Let's see, I think I'm about done here...

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.040
All right!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:33.840
Time to move onto the next area!

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:36.840
Hero-sama?!

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:37.970
Shinku!

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.640
Shinku, are you all right?

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.310
What happened?

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:46.180
Well, I, uh...

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:48.810
saw some little people...

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:50.350
Little people?

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:51.440
Could it be?

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.570
They're Dryads!

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:58.650
Dry...?

00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:01.530
They're a type of spirit.

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:05.290
We won't hurt you, Dryad-sama!

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:08.790
I'd like to be friends with you.

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.620
Would you?

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:18.970
Thank you very much!

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:22.550
See?

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.310
Aren't they cute?

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:28.230
N-Nice to meet you.

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:33.440
They're very curious and friendly beings.

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:34.190
See?

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:38.530
Hello.

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:46.370
Can I have this nut?

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:51.620
They help out people and animals that are in need.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:55.250
You're hungry, aren't you?

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:57.880
To be honest, yes.

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:02.010
Thank you, Dryad-sama.

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:06.890
They like to get these in return.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.180
What's that?

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:10.060
Bits of mineral salt.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.350
The Dryads love salt!

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:17.150
I'm glad I made our dogs hold onto some.

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:23.280
Are they trying to tell us something?

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:24.280
What is it?

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:26.280
Okay.

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:29.040
You need some help?

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:32.290
Over there... at the pass?

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.920
The cave there has...

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:36.670
A demon?!

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:37.800
What?!

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:41.340
And it abducted the Dryad princess?!

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:43.880
We need to go!

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:45.970
Rebecca to Shinku!

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:47.720
Becky!

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:48.850
Good timing.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:51.350
We need your help!

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:57.110
There's a demon on this mountain!

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:05.990
That thing's huge!

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:08.200
It looks like a low-class demon, but...

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.330
it's gotten quite huge.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.750
It's devouring the crystal trees!

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.960
It was just eating whole chunks of ore, too!

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:21.960
It'll eat up all of the crystals and ore on this mountain!

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:25.590
Where'd it take your princess?

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.060
In its <i>stomach?!</i>

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.100
It <i>ate</i> the princess?!

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:40.770
I think the demon swallows crystals and spirits and slowly absorbs their power.

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:44.740
If it hasn't been long since it swallowed the princess...

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.110
We still have a chance!

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.490
Hold it!

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:54.540
All living things need to eat!

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.750
I can't blame you for that...

00:12:57.290 --> 00:13:01.840
But your gluttony and violence against spirits

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.380
will <i>not</i> be allowed!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.720
If you understand us, please listen.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:07.010
If not...

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:18.270
Biscotti's Hero...

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:19.650
And lord...

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.070
will slay you!

00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:30.950
What in the world...

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.950
Don't listen to it!

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:49.300
The pitcher winds up!

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:48.720
What?!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.100
Stop right there!

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:12.160
Princess!

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:17.580
Yukikaze Ninjutsu...

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:21.580
Double Flower Tornado!

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:25.460
What?!

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:28.470
He got me!

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:30.680
Yukkii!

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:47.570
No way!

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:47.570
No!

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.070
It's all sticky...

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.380
Take this!

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:09.010
Solar...

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:14.090
That's—

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:26.610
This is disgusting.

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:29.360
I need to hurry!

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:37.410
That's it!

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:41.410
Shinku! Shinku!

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:42.750
Shinku!

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:44.750
Shinku!

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:46.250
Hang in there!

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:47.880
I'll be right...

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:58.640
You're not going anywhere.

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:01.890
Not until you let our hero go!

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:07.400
You can't possibly shoot this far...

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:13.990
He got me...

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:18.780
Are you the Dryad princess?

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:22.410
I'm here to help you.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:23.910
Just hang in there, okay?

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:28.340
Let's get out of here.

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:30.210
Hang tight, okay?

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:32.670
All right...

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.200
Not good enough?

00:16:57.450 --> 00:16:58.660
How about...

00:16:58.660 --> 00:16:59.700
this?!

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:03.330
Double Solar Flare Sword!

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:19.430
Take this!

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:23.180
King Flare Fang!

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:29.350
Bottom of the ninth, two outs...

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.200
Shinku!

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:46.080
Hero-sama!

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:48.580
Yukkii, Rico!

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:50.080
Shinku!

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:52.340
Becky, Princess!

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:54.090
Shinku!

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:54.960
I'm glad you're safe!

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:55.920
Thanks!

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:59.340
I'm sorry I worried you, Princess.

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:01.850
Yuki-chan, is that demon...

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:03.890
Yeah.

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:08.350
A cursed sword was what caused it.

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:11.360
No wonder it was so tough.

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:14.980
But Shinku defeated it all by himself!

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:16.990
He really did!

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:19.740
Our hero is really something.

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:24.790
And you saved our princess, Rebecca-dono!

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:27.540
I have to thank you for that, too!

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:30.500
I'm glad we're all okay!

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:32.880
<i>After that,</i>

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:36.760
<i>Yukkii sealed the cursed sword,</i>

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:46.390
<i>and the frog god that had been
possessed returned to his home.</i>

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:53.940
<i>And, of course, the Dryad princess returned to her people,</i>

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:59.150
<i>and once again, order had returned to the mountain!</i>

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:06.790
<i>So, now that we've finished our research and demon slaying...</i>

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:16.420
I'm in heaven.

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:18.800
It's so nice and warm...

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:22.180
The temperature is just right.

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:25.180
'Tis good to be alive!

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:28.930
Thanks for your help, guys.

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:33.310
But really, this place is great!

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:36.270
Huh?

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:37.570
Princess?

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:41.150
Oh, Dryads?

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:41.990
What's up?

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:47.490
Oh, I can have this?

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:48.950
Thanks!

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:52.710
Hmm, is it fruit juice?

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:55.040
It smells so good!

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:57.130
Thanks!

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:03.090
It's... good...

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:11.600
Wh-What ish dis...

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:13.480
Shinku?

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.230
What happened?

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:17.150
We're coming in!

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:18.570
Shinku?

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:20.070
Sh-Shinku!

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:21.530
Are you all right?!

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:26.990
Ah, it's the Dryads' special tonic.

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:29.620
Is that...

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:32.620
It's a warm drink that they make.

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:37.960
It's an excellent source of nutrition and energy, but...

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:43.340
First-timers like him get knocked out, as you can see.

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:48.470
He'll get woozy and maybe get a nosebleed,

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:51.140
but once he wakes up, he'll feel better than ever!

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:52.890
He'll be okay.

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:54.730
I see.

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:58.560
You don't have to worry, Dryads.

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:01.400
Our hero, Shinku, will be all right!

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:08.450
I'm glad we made it a little early!

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:11.410
Flying at top speed was quite tiring.

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:15.660
The hot springs here will fix you up in no time!

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:20.670
Let's jump right in and surprise Millhi-nee!

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:23.420
We're here!

00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:24.630
Pardon me.

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:26.930
Couvre has arrived to...

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:33.010
P-Princess...

00:21:33.010 --> 00:21:34.810
Princess, what are you...

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:37.890
No, Eclair, it's not what it looks like!

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:40.560
Looks like fun!

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:42.520
Let me join!

00:21:42.520 --> 00:21:44.570
Rico, Yuki...

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:46.490
I need an explanation <i>now!</i>

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:48.450
Calm down, Eclair...

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:49.280
There, there...

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:53.030
We're waiting for him to recover!

00:21:53.030 --> 00:21:55.790
I'll tickle him to death!

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:57.910
Wait, don't do that!

